    "    .group_by(CATEGORY_COL)\n",
    "    .agg(pl.col(NUMERIC_COL).cast(pl.Float64, strict=False).sum())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(plan.explain())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7fd7cf13",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Observation:** _[The query plan demonstrates two key lazy optimizations in Polars:\n",
    "\n",
    "Projection Pushdown (⁠PROJECT 2/16 COLUMNS⁠): Instead of loading the whole dataset, Polars only reads the 2 required columns (⁠discounted_price⁠ and ⁠category⁠) from the CSV.\n",
    "\n",
    "Predicate Pushdown (⁠SELECTION⁠ directly inside CSV SCAN): The filtering step is pushed down to the initial scan level rather than executed after loading the entire file.\n",
    "\n",
    "]_"
   ]
  },
